image built from this repository contain parts of them.

- Strands Agents TypeScript SDK (strands-agents/harness-sdk), Apache-2.0.
  Bundled into the agent component.
- ComponentizeJS and StarlingMonkey (Bytecode Alliance), Apache-2.0.
  StarlingMonkey embeds SpiderMonkey (Mozilla), MPL-2.0.
- AWS SDK for JavaScript (Bedrock Runtime client), Apache-2.0.
- Wasmtime 49 (Bytecode Alliance), Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception.
- Rust crates including tokio, axum, cel and jsonschema, MIT or Apache-2.0;
  see runner/Cargo.lock for the full list.
